        46.069705963134766,
        235.38702392578125,
        427.8284606933594,
        259.1521301269531
      ],
      "text": "28\nWhat assists the electronic translator during lectures at Karlsruhe Institute\nof Technology?\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        69.82432556152344,
        267.4198303222656,
        247.39395141601562,
        319.9816589355469
