      "text": "A__ the repeated content of lectures\nB\nthe students’ reading skills\nC\nthe languages used\nD _ the lecturers’ technical ability\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        45.70975875854492,
        333.28497314453125,
        454.8080139160156,
        365.6910095214844
      ],
      "text": "29\nWhen referring to The Hitchhiker's Guide to the Galaxy, the writer suggests that\nA__ the Babel fish was considered undesirable at the time.\n"
