      "box": [
        45.34983825683594,
        418.2258605957031,
        315.1811828613281,
        460.34539794921875
      ],
      "text": "30\nWhat does the writer say about sharing earpieces?\nA__\nltis something people will get used to doing.\nB_\nThe reluctance to do this is understandable.\n"
